  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n{他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\nPattern: [something]を{見極|みきわ}める\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{見極|みきわ}めている typically indicates an ongoing process of discernment.\n\n- {見極|みきわ}めない (negative)\n- {見極|みきわ}めて (te-form)\n- {見極|みきわ}めた (past)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {真偽|しんぎ}を{見極|みきわ}める - to discern truth from falsehood\n- {本質|ほんしつ}を{見極|みきわ}める - to see through to the essence\n- タイミングを{見極|みきわ}める - to judge the timing\n- {可能性|かのうせい}を{見極|みきわ}める - to assess the possibilities\n\nCOMPOUND VERB:\n{見|み} (see) + {極|きわ}める (to reach the extreme/master) → to see to the core\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {見抜|みぬ}く - to see through (deception)\n- {判断|はんだん}する - to judge",
